{
  "id": "levoprome",
  "term": "Levoprome",
  "definition": "Levoprome refers to levomepromazine, a phenothiazine typical antipsychotic with calming, sleep-inducing, anxiety-reducing, anti-nausea, pain-relieving, and antipsychotic effects. Its effects are linked to blocking several central nervous system receptor types, including adrenergic, dopamine, histamine, cholinergic, and serotonin receptors.",
